@startuml ppo_algorithm_phases_new
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 9

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Phase 1: Experience Collection**\nSample trajectories\nStore (s,a,r,s') tuples\nCollect T episodes] as Phase1 #E6F3FF

component [**Phase 2: Advantage Estimation**\nCompute GAE advantages Â_t\nCalculate returns R_t^total\nλ = 0.95, γ = 0.99] as Phase2 #E6FFE6

component [**Phase 3: Policy Update**\nMinibatch SGD\nK epochs per update\nPPO clipped objective] as Phase3 #FFE6E6

Phase1 --> Phase2 : Trajectory Data
Phase2 --> Phase3 : Advantages & Returns
Phase3 --> Phase1 : Updated Policy π_θ

note bottom of Phase3 : L^CLIP(θ) = E[min(r_t Â_t, clip(r_t, 1-ε, 1+ε) Â_t)]\nε = 0.2 clipping parameter

@enduml
